{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:AppendixSurrealsArchimedean.WenzlPositivityImpliesSubstratePositivity","@type":"LeanModule","name":"AppendixSurrealsArchimedean.WenzlPositivityImpliesSubstratePositivity","imports":["lean:module:Init"],"declarations":3,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AppendixSurreals.WenzlPositivityImpliesSubstratePositivity.holds","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AppendixSurreals.WenzlPositivityImpliesSubstratePositivity.holds","kind":"theorem","line":62,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/appendix-surreals-archimedean/wenzl-positivity-implies-substrate-positivity.lean#L62-L62","doc":"The bridge claim: Wenzl-positivity of Rep(U_q(sl_2)) at q_0\n∈ R_{>1} implies substrate C*-Frobenius positivity (Müger /\nBKLR sense) of the QOU Frobenius–Hopf substrate. The class\ninstance is the §3b-cond conjectural witness. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AppendixSurreals.WenzlPositivityImpliesSubstratePositivity.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AppendixSurreals.WenzlPositivityImpliesSubstratePositivity.mk","kind":"ctor","line":55,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/appendix-surreals-archimedean/wenzl-positivity-implies-substrate-positivity.lean#L55-L55","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AppendixSurreals.WenzlPositivityImpliesSubstratePositivity","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AppendixSurreals.WenzlPositivityImpliesSubstratePositivity","kind":"class","line":46,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/appendix-surreals-archimedean/wenzl-positivity-implies-substrate-positivity.lean#L46-L62","doc":"**CONJECTURE.** Wenzl positivity of Rep(U_q(sl_2)) at q = q_0\n∈ R_{>1} implies the substrate C*-Frobenius positivity axiom\nneeded by `OSReflectionPositivity`.\n\nThe two propositions are **parameters**, not constructions: neither\n`WenzlPositivityAt(q_0)` nor the substrate positivity axiom is\nformalised yet (the docstring above calls the upstream one\n\"future\"), and parameterising is what lets this carrier state the\nbridge without pre-empting either. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:conj:wenzl-positivity-implies-substrate-positivity","label":"conj:wenzl-positivity-implies-substrate-positivity","md":"quantum-observable-universe/appendix-surreals-archimedean/wenzl-positivity-implies-substrate-positivity.md"}],"signatureChunk":0}]}